# Docker never reads .gitignore. The server images COPY whole directories from this context, so on a
# developer checkout the git-ignored bytecode (it embeds the builder's home path), the host-built
# WhatsApp bridge node_modules (the images ship no Node) and env files would be sent and copied in.
# The frontend image has its own myrm-agent-frontend/Dockerfile.dockerignore.
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
